Description:

Removed support for CalDAV/JMAP calendar secretary mode. This was an
experimental feature introduced in 3.8.0 and it was broken since. We
removed JMAP support for it in 2022 but kept leftovers in the CalDAV
implementation. Now it gets removed entirely.

The "shareesActAs" property of the JMAP calendar account is gone. The
DAV property {urn:ietf:params:jmap:calendars}sharees-act-as on the
calendar home still can be read using PROPFIND. It only can be removed
using PROPPATCH, setting it to any value, including the formerly
allowed values "self" and "secretary", now is forbidden.


Documentation:

None.


Config changes:

None.


Upgrade instructions:

Installations that set this experimental property may want to remove
it using a PROPPATCH remove instruction.


